    rdfs:label "Fresh narrow lineage: SEN0414 Chapters 19 and 20"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.6.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch19ch20-lineage/1.6.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch19ch20_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment "1.6.0 (2026-11-12): Drafts of chapters 19 and 20 written and spot-checked against live sources; the owner approval gate is Ready. No build before approval."@en .

ex:TK8_Draft_Ch19 backlog:hasState backlog:Done ; backlog:hasAuditNote "Wrote 03-materials/ch19/DRAFT_ch19_v1_0_0.md: 6 sourced stories, 41-slide outline, 18 examples, analogies, 14 links (each answered 200 on 2026-11-12), open items." .
ex:TK8_Draft_Ch20 backlog:hasState backlog:Done ; backlog:hasAuditNote "Wrote 03-materials/ch20/DRAFT_ch20_v1_0_0.md: 6 sourced stories, 41-slide outline, 19 examples, analogies, 14 links (each answered 200 on 2026-11-12), open items." .
ex:TK8_DraftVerify_Ch19 backlog:hasState backlog:Done ; backlog:hasAuditNote "Re-read by WebSearch on 2026-11-12 (Wikipedia is not fetchable here, so its claims were checked against other sources): Unix manual 3 Nov 1971 and 1971 epoch in sixtieths of a second (Bell Labs/Ritchie page, TUHS); 2038 limit 03:14:07 UTC; 27 leap seconds, last 31 Dec 2016, CGPM 2022 resolution 4 for 2035; tz lawsuit 30 Sep 2011, database removed 6 Oct, ICANN 14 Oct, dismissed 22 Feb 2012 (EFF, ICANN list); Gregorian bull 24 Feb 1582, 4 then 15 Oct. Cron: Brown at Purdue confirmed in outline only (a secondary source adds Keith Williamson, 1979); the draft keeps the Wikipedia wording. Same agent as the writer, so not independent; the owner may overrule." .
ex:TK8_DraftVerify_Ch20 backlog:hasState backlog:Done ; backlog:hasAuditNote "Re-read by WebSearch on 2026-11-12: Tomlinson 1971 and @ (Internet Hall of Fame); RFC 821 Postel August 1982, obsoleted by RFC 2821 (rfc-editor); SMS 3 Dec 1992, Papworth to Jarvis (NPR, Vodafone-based sources); Gmail 1 April 2004 with 1 GB; AT&T gateway ended 17 June 2025. One defect found and fixed: the first spam recipient count differs by source (293, 393, about 400, 600), so the draft now states that and the slide will say several hundred. Same agent as the writer, so not independent; the owner may overrule." .
ex:ST8_DraftCh19 backlog:hasState backlog:Done .
ex:ST8_DraftCh20 backlog:hasState backlog:Done .
